11-25, card C03633-K1 held by customer C03633 was used for 4 transaction(s) totalling $1,935.29 that the bank has determined were not authorised by the cardholder (transaction IDs 3487284, 3487318, 3487340, 3487348). The activity was online, from device profile(s) MacOS | Mac OS X 10_8_5 | chrome 49.0 | 1280x800, billed to region code(s) 191. The alert was raised on 2016-11-25 21:21:00 by risk score on transaction 3487348 ($477.74). The purchases were placed minutes apart with each amount just below $500, consistent with deliberately keeping each authorization under a review threshold; the bank has seen the identical shape on five other cardholders, all confirmed fraud. The activity was identified by the bank's transaction monitoring and confirmed by investigation. The card has been blocked pending reissue; this report is filed because fraud is suspected and exposure $1,935.29 exceeds $1,000; the pattern is coordinated or undocumented (R9).","subjects":["C03633","C03633-K1","MacOS | Mac OS X 10_8_5 | chrome 49.0 | 1280x800"],"total_amount_usd":1935.29,"activity_dates":["2016-11-25","2016-11-25"]},"stop_reason":"Policy \u00a76: the customer denies the transaction, which settles the question. No further evidence would change the decision.","tool_calls":8,"tokens":0,"latency_s":0.04},"kind":"monitor"}